<title>USA: ATC Group says warrants exercisable.</title>
<headline>ATC Group says warrants exercisable.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>ATC Group Services Inc said on Thursday the Securities and Exchange Commission has declared its registration statement relating to its class C warrants effective.</p>
<p>Holders of ATC's outstanding class C warrants expiring April 30, 1998, subject to ATC's right of earlier redemption, may now exercise such warrants.</p>
</text>
